\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 5. Security & Business Rules\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls31\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Authoritative Calculations
\f1\b0 : Never trust client-submitted advance amounts or balance sums. The 25% advance is computed and verified strictly on the server (
\f2\fs26 Math.round(totalOrderValue * 0.25)
\f1\fs24 ).\
\ls31\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Outlet Ownership Isolation
\f1\b0 : Every festival collection and product mutation verifies the user's role and 
\f2\fs26 outlet_id
\f1\fs24  match. Supabase Row Level Security (RLS) ensures outlets only access their own records.\
\ls31\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Booking Window & Capacity Safeguards
\f1\b0 : Server rejects pre-booking orders if the current time is outside 
\f2\fs26 [booking_start_at, booking_end_at]
\f1\fs24  or if confirmed units exceed 
\f2\fs26 max_booking_quantity
\f1\fs24 .\
\ls31\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Inventory Ring-Fencing
\f1\b0 : Pre-booked units are locked and can never be consumed by regular on-demand cart checkouts. Normal sales draw solely from the declared "extra planned stock".\
\ls31\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Idempotent Balance Recording
\f1\b0 : Balance collection at delivery validates that 
\f2\fs26 balance_amount > 0
\f1\fs24  and atomically transitions 
\f2\fs26 payment_status
\f1\fs24  from 
\f2\fs26 partially_paid
\f1\fs24  to 
\f2\fs26 paid
\f1\fs24  to prevent double entry.\
}